// The mine's cave sheet, drawn by tools/Nosum.MapGen (sheets; docs/adr/ADR-042 P2).
// Tile 0 is the floor and tile 1 the wall: MineGenerator reads these two, and the wall must not be Passable.
// Walkable, no traits: 0 floor, 2 to 4 floor variants, 32 ladder up, 33 and 34 elevator markers, 35 to 47 decor.
// Solid, on the Buildings layer: 1 wall, 16 to 31 wall edges (one per set of open sides).
name cave
image cave.png
tilewidth 16
tileheight 16
columns 16
tilecount 48
tile 1 Impassable
tile 16-31 Impassable
